      "changelog": "\u003ch3\u003eAdded\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdded config option to set the base energy usage of the Controller (default is 0).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdded Grid Filter item to filter items in any Grid.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdded support for processing patterns with big stacksizes.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdded Network Transmitter, Network Receiver and Network Cards.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eChanged\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe slot where the Wireless Grid is in in the Wireless Grid GUI is now disabled, so the item can\u0027t be thrown out of the inventory by accident.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChanged Relay recipe to use redstone torch instead of Basic Processor.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePlaced machines now face the block they are placed on, like hoppers.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFixed\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFixed rendering crash with Disk Drive.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFixed crash when quickly toggling sorting direction in Grid.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFixed not being able to clear exporter row in interface.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n",
